# Error Handling

DocPilot adheres to RFC 7807 (Problem Details for HTTP APIs). All error responses return `application/problem+json` with a consistent JSON envelope:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded",
    "message": "Too many requests. Please wait 45 seconds.",
    "param": null,
    "doc_url": "https://docs.docpilot.io/errors/rate-limit"
  }
}
```

Common error codes include `invalid_token` (401), `forbidden_action` (403), `resource_not_found` (404), and `rate_limit_exceeded` (429).
